hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17127","Abu al-Mughirah narrated to us, he said: Hariz narrated to us, he said: I heard Abd Allah ibn Amir al-Alhani, he said: Habis ibn Sad al-Tai entered the mosque before dawn, and he had met the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and saw the people praying in the front of the mosque. He said: Show-offs, by the Lord of the Kabah. Frighten them; whoever frightens them has obeyed Allah and His Messenger. He said: The people came to them and drove them out. He said: He said: The angels pray before dawn in the front of the mosque."
